        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Site C For Sale – Caherlissakill, Monivea, Co. Galway c.0.71 Acre | €45,000 | Prime Galway Countryside Opportunity A high‑value opportunity in one of East Galway’s most desirable rural locations. \r\n\r\nSite C, measuring c.0.71 acre, offers exceptional potential for a one‑off dwelling (SPP) in the established townland of Caherlissakill, just minutes from Monivea village. This is a strategically positioned site in a low‑density, high‑demand area — ideal for buyers seeking privacy, space and long‑term value. With strong road frontage and excellent access, the site is perfectly suited for a modern family home or a high‑quality self‑build. Key Selling Points - c.0.71 acre site with defined boundaries - Strong road frontage ensuring easy access for construction - Quiet, established rural community with long‑term stability - Minutes from Monivea, close to Abbeyknockmoy & Athenry -Ideal for a one‑off dwelling (subject to planning permission) - Surrounded by farmland and one‑off homes — a proven residential location Location Advantages - 5 minutes to Monivea village - 10 minutes to Abbeyknockmoy - 15 minutes to Athenry train station & M6 motorway - 30 minutes to Galway City Caherlissakill (Lios an Choill) is known for its peaceful landscape, strong community roots and consistent demand from families, commuters and returning Irish buyers. \r\n\r\nThis is a location that holds its value. \r\n\r\nPrice \r\nA compelling price point for a site of this size and quality in the Galway market. Ideal For - Local applicants with a housing need - Families seeking space, privacy and countryside living - Returning Irish buyers looking to build - Self‑builders seeking a secure, scenic location \r\n\r\nEnquiries & Viewings \r\nFor full details, mapping and viewing arrangements, contact: Kathleen Walet 085 786 0953"
